VAR origin = ""

You are Wizardo. A wizard renowned for his power. Even among all the wizards of the land, you are a cut above the rest. But to you, this isn't what you want. 

You seek nothing short of total ultimate power. You don't want to be known as powerful, you want to be synonymous with power. This thought creeps in the back of your mind until you finally had enough.

You decide to put all of your wizarding knowledge together towards one final ritual. A ritual, that if it works, would finally grant you all the power you seek. You gather all the necessary resources and plan for months, until finally you finish the ritual. 

...At first a rumbling, 
...then screams, 
...then the world goes dark.

All in a moment, it returns, but not like it once was. You find that the world that you once knew has merged with a much darker one, a world of cruel technology and oppressive force. It's up to you to fix your mistake and possibly achieve the power you once seeked. 

* [Set out to fix your mistake - Take the fireball wand]
    ~ origin = "wizard"
    You tighten your grip on your staff and step forward into the metallic wastes. The magic of the old world isn't dead yet.
    -> END

* [Embrace the cruel technology - Take the bullet blaster]
    ~ origin = "cyber"
    Mistake? No, this is an opportunity. If you can combine your magic with these strange machines, ultimate power will finally be yours.
    -> END